  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Entrepreneurs Finance Initiative (WE-FI): G20 multi-donor facility to support women owned/led Small Medium sized Enterprises (SMEs) in developing countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Women Entrepreneurs Finance Initiative (WE-FI): G20 multi-donor facility to support women owned/led Small Medium sized Enterprises (SMEs) in developing countries is a component of UK support for Women Entrepreneurs Finance Initiative (We-Fi) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,850,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Formal sector financial intermediaries, Financial policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
